/// Wild Empathy, this IS a real activated ability ("swift action...
/// usable %1 minutes per day", `BONUS:VAR|HunterAnimalFocusMinutes|
/// HunterLVL`), the same activation-gating pattern Judgment/Rage/Mutagen
