        // SD-32 T12 Epic 8 row 18 cycle 22 (`§27b`): `Sorcerer Bloodline` 45/52 -> 48/52 (+3) --
        // the EIGHTH real corpus header shape (`pool_group_header_vars_merged`'s own new doc: the
